{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "564e984b342bc9ae15fff97e517b7ce98d96d099c5bc603601af97ee4fd1543e", "ja": "ふぅ～……うふふっ……。", "zh": "呼～呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dfb897e82e7c07dc60f974ced7dc256f5fec773084c64569f8708aa0cf39ca01", "ja": "朋花、今日はずっとウキウキと楽しそうだな！", "zh": "朋花，你今天一直雀跃不已，看起来很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "eaf0c62c60d9d1dfc853601bfa54f37fbcf1e57b5e7f1a91791c6b9c9de0b9b9", "ja": "あら、ウキウキと……そう見えましたか～？\nそれは私としたことが、少し問題ですね～。", "zh": "哎呀，雀跃不已……我看起来是这样吗～？\n那样对我来说有点问题呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4be968081cc8f947382215d945a342b864d1e73ba3916637c07c55df3d28d483", "ja": "……ん？　問題なのか？", "zh": "……嗯？这是问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "3082c85e2e8841804e3c6415890bb3bdea202e4c59173952b1d551a9bff3b4a7", "ja": "ふふっ……聖母の笑顔は皆のものですから。\nでも……たまにはいいでしょう。許してあげます～♪", "zh": "呵呵……因为圣母的笑容是属于大家的。\n不过……偶尔一次也无妨，我原谅你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9a39742ca25f983f92149edcf6b6296fcf684c9f11bd220cdb5f76290e6b7702", "ja": "何を許してもらったのか、よくわからないけど、\nありがとう……。", "zh": "虽然不懂为什么被原谅，\n但是谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "b325a6c526ef02dff7002274b1bce9fbec96d04186e19e3f392a51ee638901b2", "ja": "わかりませんか～……。まあ、子ども達や動物達との\n触れ合いは楽しかったということです～♪", "zh": "你不懂啊……算了，就当作是\n我跟孩子们还有动物们互动得很开心吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "1ff37fc4e102a867c09dbda6c7be001cb833c7c41e346bc897a68b8469e0dfbd", "ja": "でも、今日の成功に気をよくして、\n調子に乗っちゃダメですよ～？", "zh": "不过，\n你可不能因为今天的成功而得寸进尺喔～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "d21a479cfc41995937f7bbc8c7f10b9c51455c60f5f3380a64c94f179440c2d7", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、私の従者ですから、\n今後も、でしゃばらずに尽くしてくださいね～？", "zh": "毕竟{$P$}先生是我的随从，\n今后可得继续努力，不能太出风头喔～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "917ef1f4561c5aa9febcdc857924f8cf2e27a6cabda7655681f167c7cc48b567", "ja": "もちろん、プロデューサーとして必要なことは、\nできる限り、努力するつもりだよ。", "zh": "那当然，身为制作人该做的事，\n我会努力做到最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "933a36d2bec1d85396a9861a43590269f5c4003163102433e16526bb333dd0de", "ja": "っと、もうこんな時間か。そろそろ帰ろう、送るよ。", "zh": "啊，已经这么晚啦。差不多该回家了，我送你回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0033_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "4ee71cee2511098bbde415711f76299fb7b7fb18d3954a9395167e7d8754afb7", "ja": "ふふっ♪　……本当に、ダメプロデューサー♪", "zh": "呵呵♪你啊，真的是个无能制作人……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
